{"id":"25037916-f580-4665-a20b-eb94c363ed08","caseId":"kennedy-01","repeat":2,"started":{"utc":"2026-10-20T22:35:22.410Z","monotonicMs":144789.129125},"status":"returned","messagesSha256":"4aa146a99caa715d2e5f4bd08d44ccaefc5e5d9026fc8a0719e524e68ffbf5f4","question":"Quel ordre de grandeur historique Kennedy utilise-t-il ?","firstTokenMs":null,"quality":null,"httpStatus":200,"headersReceivedMs":7059.119602999999,"fixtureServer":false,"responseBytes":898,"responseSha256":"ec51781e043fd230084df8ff1b16c54890eabbb9965a2ee1d78df346ad3f452e","answer":{"answer":"Kennedy utilise un ordre de grandeur de 50 000 ans pour l'histoire enregistrée de l'humanité, qu'il compare à une période d'environ un demi-siècle. Il précise ensuite que nous ne savons très peu de choses sur les 40 premières années de cette période.","kind":"observation","citations":[{"id":"moment-2","startMs":8000,"endMs":16000},{"id":"moment-3","startMs":16000,"endMs":24000}],"sources":[],"limits":[]},"finishReason":"stop","model":"qwen3.8:27b","usage":null,"ollamaTimings":{"total_duration":7057709927,"load_duration":716837,"prompt_eval_duration":156659000,"eval_duration":6701287000,"prompt_eval_count":1552,"eval_count":189},"thinkingChars":0,"citationChecks":[{"id":"moment-2","startMs":8000,"endMs":16000,"withinProvidedEvidence":true},{"id":"moment-3","startMs":16000,"endMs":24000,"withinProvidedEvidence":true}],"finished":{"utc":"2026-10-20T22:35:29.472Z","monotonicMs":151850.749674},"clientTotalMs":7061.620548999985}
