{"id":"b0697706-05a6-46af-b6db-bad564695e8f","caseId":"kennedy-05","repeat":2,"started":{"utc":"2026-10-20T22:35:37.606Z","monotonicMs":159985.351867},"status":"returned","messagesSha256":"e598f9258ee188df2b89121ae41d29449f6d649e65a1aef87f351c06a08c828b","question":"Que dit-il de l'exploration et du rôle des États-Unis ?","firstTokenMs":null,"quality":null,"httpStatus":200,"headersReceivedMs":7249.864836999972,"fixtureServer":false,"responseBytes":1040,"responseSha256":"fa67008271c0cd3051da67bd4822cbf0663035440af32b0d39f02fa0b46d2656","answer":{"answer":"Kennedy affirme que l'exploration spatiale est une grande aventure inévitable et que les États-Unis ne peuvent pas rester en arrière s'ils veulent diriger les autres nations. Il souligne que la quête de connaissance de l'homme est déterminée et ne peut être arrêtée.","kind":"observation","citations":[{"id":"moment-24","startMs":184000,"endMs":192000},{"id":"moment-25","startMs":192000,"endMs":200000}],"sources":[],"limits":["Les transcriptions sont des résumés automatiques potentiellement imprécis et non des citations exactes."]},"finishReason":"stop","model":"qwen3.8:27b","usage":null,"ollamaTimings":{"total_duration":7248658939,"load_duration":819606,"prompt_eval_duration":144004000,"eval_duration":6898051000,"prompt_eval_count":2042,"eval_count":216},"thinkingChars":0,"citationChecks":[{"id":"moment-24","startMs":184000,"endMs":192000,"withinProvidedEvidence":true},{"id":"moment-25","startMs":192000,"endMs":200000,"withinProvidedEvidence":true}],"finished":{"utc":"2026-10-20T22:35:44.858Z","monotonicMs":167237.546337},"clientTotalMs":7252.194470000017}
